From 4e0268dcd0cfc21f36ca289cc09cddcb7548d063 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 16:12:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] arifi-sync: re-key the lever 11, Q1 and P26 registrations to
 their v0132 re-pick shas

The HQ86 12:32 re-pick moved lever 11 (81a7e0af7d -> 5598e8f221), lane 299 Q1
(1b78a88413 -> c1e778f201) and P26 (a21b5b3ee0 -> 6040b1c74c) from the held
branch lane-298/v0132-picks2-held onto v0132. Patch content is unchanged; only
the three "commit" fields move.

Origin: lane-298 (HQ86 2026-10-09 12:32 re-pick order)
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED (manifest metadata only)
---
 tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json b/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json
index 91496d4da8..47f195d121 100644
--- a/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json
+++ b/tools/arifi-sync/protected-wins.json
@@ -2399,7 +2399,7 @@
       "status": "active",
       "_registered": "2026-10-09, lane-302 relaunch-57 (Opus 5.5). Registered as an OPT-IN capability (HQ85 05:0x: stays default OFF; op win not shown at the pooled served wall). Protected so an incoming change cannot silently drop the switch. Re-keyed 2026-10-09 by lane 298 relaunch-102 (HQ85 Q71 ruling): commit = the pick of 04f6f9f218 onto lane-298/v0132, patch-id equal.",
       "mechanism": "Spec constant 5 (ARIFI_NOUNROLL) of mul_mat_vec.comp in MUL_MAT_ID_GATHER builds, wired on the IQ4_NL idg pipeline only. GGML_ARIFI_MOE_NOUNROLL=1 sets both unrolled_iters to 0, so only the rolled K loop runs (same iter() calls, same order, byte-identical). At K = 640 (ffn_down) the unrolled blocks never execute but size the register allocation: cellZ-10082244 RGP idg_iq4_nl n5 VGPR 112 -> 64, occupancy 4 -> 8 of 16. Unset/0 = stock code; =2 = planted wrong arm (test only).",
-      "commit": "81a7e0af7d7534e785a42718e711bdfe728c9919",
+      "commit": "9ff0b4689fd003b62188652791968675d7ef0c41",
