         "ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan-types.h"
@@ -2453,7 +2453,7 @@
       "status": "active",
       "_registered": "2026-10-09, lane 298 relaunch-102 at the v0132 pick of upstream-x1 P26 480d6a95ff (HQ85 07:2x relay of upstream-x1 ASK 2+3). A capability (loader) row: protects that upstream-converted qwen4exp MTP GGUFs keep loading.",
       "mechanism": "LLM_TENSOR_NEXTN_HC_HEAD_{NORM,DOWN,UP} (blk.%d.nextn.hc_head_*) created for the qwen4exp MTP block (optional; our sidecar has none); the block's QSA indexer tensors acknowledged with TENSOR_SKIP; an MTP-only file no longer requires top-level output_hc_*. graph_mtp uses nextn.hc_head_* when present, else output_hc_*. No math change.",
